---
---
<div class="diagram-wrap">
  <p class="diagram-label">CPQ — Wait vs. Build</p>

  <div class="node-wrap">
    <div class="node node-dark node-lg">
      <div>Contractors need material estimates.</div>
      <div class="node-sub">Zuper has no CPQ engine.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="v-line"></div>

  <div class="branch-grid cols-2">
    <div class="b-col">
      <div class="v-drop"></div>
      <div class="option-card">
        <div class="option-letter">Option A</div>
        <div class="option-title">Submit to roadmap. Wait.</div>
        <div class="option-desc">Clean. No technical debt. Engineering owns it properly.</div>
        <div class="cost-row">
          <span class="cost-label">Cost</span>
          Timeline unknown. Contractors continue using SumoQuote. Nothing changes now.
        </div>
        <div class="badge badge-plain">Not chosen</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-rise"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="b-col">
      <div class="v-drop"></div>
      <div class="option-card option-card-chosen">
        <div class="option-letter option-letter-blue">Option B</div>
        <div class="option-title">Build formula workaround now</div>
        <div class="option-desc">Formulas at line-item level. Temporary by design. Document every edge.</div>
        <div class="cost-row">
          <span class="cost-label">Cost</span>
          Technical debt. Hits edges fast — but those edges become the spec for the real feature.
        </div>
        <div class="badge badge-chosen">Chosen</div>
      </div>
      <div class="v-rise"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="v-line"></div>

  <div class="node-wrap">
    <div class="node node-dark node-lg">
      Native CPQ shipped 3 months later — built directly on the workaround's edge cases
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .diagram-wrap {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-border);
    margin: 2rem 0;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  }
  .diagram-label {
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .node-wrap {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .node-lg { max-width: 420px; width: 100%; }

  .node {
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .node-dark {
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #F9F7F4;
    border-color: var(--color-primary);
    padding: 12px 20px;
  }
  .node-sub {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(249, 247, 244, 0.6);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  .v-line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 20px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .v-drop, .v-rise {
    width: 1px;
    height: 16px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .branch-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 12px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .cols-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }

  .cols-2::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    top: 8px;
    left: 25%;
    right: 25%;
  }
  .cols-2::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    bottom: 8px;
    left: 25%;
    right: 25%;
  }

  .b-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .option-card {
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-background);
    padding: 14px 16px;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .option-card-chosen {
    border-color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .option-letter {
    font-size: 9px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .option-letter-blue {
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }
  .option-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .option-desc {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .cost-row {
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-top: 8px;
  }
  .cost-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 9px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .badge-plain {
    color: var(--color-secondary);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .badge-chosen {
    background: var(--color-blue);
    color: #F9F7F4;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-blue);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .branch-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cols-2::before, .cols-2::after { display: none; }
    .v-drop, .v-rise { display: none; }
  }
</style>
